    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "49c7fb90ee8f8441",
      "translationZh": "GPU：NVIDIA RTX 3090，24 GB 显存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ab7c1e021d67e157",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp：刚从今天的 master 分支编译而来（构建版本 b10794，2026 年 9 月 4 日）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ceec505e70db1c1",
      "translationZh": "配置要点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7ee6bc21ebe5ed4",
      "translationZh": "-ngl 99 → 尽可能将所有层卸载到 GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a558b1f2fd87c33b",
      "translationZh": "-ncmoe 42 → 强制让 42 个 MoE（专家）层留在 CPU/RAM 上",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a35f12621cd137aa",
      "translationZh": "-c 204800 → 200k 上下文窗口",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46a1c9a87461d66d",
      "translationZh": "-fa on，使用 f16 K/V 缓存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "725fac4f9d5812ab",
      "translationZh": "-b 2048 / -ub 1024 → 批次 / 微批次大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3bc07772f633f0b8",
      "translationZh": "--reasoning-effort xhigh, --reasoning-budget -1, --reasoning-preserve → 完整推理模式，不截断",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5004d4906d62251f",
      "translationZh": "刚加载完成后的状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "729d55958a2f902c",
      "translationZh": "可用系统 RAM：52 GB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d29a8fa42637b30c",
      "translationZh": "因此，GPU 基本上已经满载（显存利用率良好），而 RAM 仍有充裕的约 52 GB 余量，可供卸载到 CPU 的专家和上下文使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c6d96d0cec7e13c",
      "translationZh": "实际性能（来自服务器日志）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51cee363e2b9f5c7",
      "translationZh": "提示词处理（长上下文，~12k 个 token）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea2c328f32e1cd16",
      "translationZh": "已处理 token 数 时间（s） 速度（tok/s）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d16a2bdba79dab6",
      "translationZh": "文本生成（持续生成，最多生成 ~480 个 token）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02738b315d4c6ff0",
      "translationZh": "已生成 token 数 速度（tok/s，滚动 3s）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f78120ea65d65bf4",
      "translationZh": "即使上下文增长到超过 12k 个 token，生成速度仍十分稳定地保持在 ~15.5-16 t/s 左右，提示词处理速度也稳定在 ~185-190 t/s 左右。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "70a5b5027125989d",
      "translationZh": "关于近期 llama.cpp 构建版本的说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c77d2def43d69f71",
      "translationZh": "对于日后看到这个帖子的读者，有一点值得提及：最近几个 master 构建版本已包含直接涉及该模型架构（Qwen4Exp）的改动：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37f7dec45f1481f5",
      "translationZh": "b10750（2026 年 9 月 1 日）——为 Qwen4 实验模型中的 MTP 推测解码添加循环状态回滚支持",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c273c6ce1c2634bc",
      "translationZh": "b10726（2026 年 8 月 31 日）——专门为 Qwen 3.8 Flash Next 添加了一个 Vulkan top-k 基数排序着色器（仅限 Vulkan 后端）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "56d77e1ff0f84e1a",
      "translationZh": "b10678（2026 年 8 月 28 日）——减少了 Qwen4Exp 模型的计算图拆分次数，这应该也有助于提升 CUDA 上的性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97debbaf29bfec54",
      "translationZh": "如果有人在较旧的构建版本上使用这个模型时一直受到 MTP 不稳定问题的困扰，那么在认定这是配置问题之前，值得先拉取最新版本试试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e1ffdbee60accb50",
      "translationZh": "我想向社区请教的问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf65b686294e8559",
      "translationZh": "考虑到这是一个大型 MoE（总参数约 180B / 活跃参数约 5B），分布在单张 24GB GPU + 128GB DDR4 RAM 上运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "16aacdf4744860bf",
      "translationZh": "这里将 -ncmoe 设为 42 合适吗？还是说，考虑到距离触发 OOM 还有一些显存余量，我应该把更多或更少的专家层放到 GPU 上？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ffdb9193bd03434",
      "translationZh": "考虑到卸载到 CPU 的专家很可能是瓶颈，大家有什么建议，可以在提示词处理（调整 -b/-ub）或生成阶段进一步提高 t/s 吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "73d0dec51c61c33e",
      "translationZh": "在官方/主线 llama.cpp 上，这个模型的 MTP 推测解码已经能可靠运行了吗，还是仍然不太稳定？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89d1f07dcca4af76",
      "translationZh": "针对这个特定的模型 + 硬件组合，有人推荐其他配置/参数吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11ce6b1fa8fc9e6d",
      "translationZh": "欢迎任何建议——如果有帮助，我很乐意提供更多日志！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac0a74f930c6a384",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/cezarducatti 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
